   "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>body{margin:0;font-family:'DejaVu Sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#1a1a1a;background:#fff}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th{background:#dfe7f2;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #b9c5d6;font-weight:bold}td{padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #d5dbe4;vertical-align:top}td,th{white-space:nowrap}.bar{background:#1f4e8c;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold}.sub{background:#eef2f7;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#333;border-bottom:1px solid #b9c5d6}.tile{border:1px solid #a9b7cc;border-radius:3px;padding:6px 8px;margin:6px;background:#f7f9fc;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:220px}.tile b{font-size:14px}.hdr{background:#f1f4f8;border-bottom:2px solid #1f4e8c;padding:6px 10px;font-size:13px}.hdr b{font-size:15px}.msg{border:1px solid #ccd;border-radius:4px;padding:8px 10px;margin:8px 10px;max-width:620px}.me{background:#e8f1ff}.from{font-size:11px;color:#555;margin-bottom:4px}</style></head><body><div class='bar'>MyChart Message - Re: Side effects after Tuesday infusion</div>\n<div class='msg'><div class='from'>From: Szczepanski, Dorota &nbsp; Sent: 11/06/2026 7:42 PM</div>Hi, this is Dorota Szczepanski (DOB 5/16/1965). Since my Tuesday infusion I have had nausea most of the day and the ondansetron is not helping much. My daughter Agnieszka says I look pale. Best number is 555-0188 or email dszczep65@fastmail.example. Should I come in early Thursday?</div>\n<div class='msg me'><div class='from'>From: Oncology Infusion RN Pool &nbsp; Sent: 11/07/2026 8:15 AM</div>Thank you for letting us know. Please continue ondansetron every 8 hours and add prochlorperazine 10 mg as prescribed. If you are unable to keep fluids down or have a fever over 100.4 F, call the clinic line. We will plan extra hydration at Thursday's visit.</div>\n<div class='msg'><div class='from'>From: Szczepanski, Dorota &nbsp; Sent: 11/07/2026 9:02 AM</div>Thank you. My neighbor Tomasz Grabowski will drive me, he will wait at 418 Harbor View Dr if that matters for parking.</div></body></html>"
